B.Rw=new A.bc("ruqyah-1","Prophetic Dua for Pain & Illness (7x)","Place right hand on where it hurts","\u0628\u0650\u0633\u0652\u0645\u0650 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0647\u0650 (\u0663x)\n\u0623\u064e\u0639\u064f\u0648\u0630\u064f \u0628\u0650\u0627\u0644\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0647\u0650 \u0648\u064e\u0642\u064f\u062f\u0652\u0631\u064e\u062a\u0650\u0647\u0650 \u0645\u0650\u0646\u0652 \u0634\u064e\u0631\u0650\u0651 \u0645\u064e\u0627 \u0623\u064e\u062c\u0650\u062f\u064f \u0648\u064e\u0623\u064f\u062d\u064e\u0627\u0630\u0650\u0631\u064f (\u0667x)","Bismillah (3x). A'udhu billahi wa qudratihi min sharri ma ajidu wa uhadhir (7x)","In the Name of Allah (3 times). I seek refuge in Allah and in His power from the evil of what I find and of what I fear (7 times).","Sahih Muslim 2202",7,"Uthman ibn Abi Al-'As \u0631\u0636\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0647 \u0639\u0646\u0647 complained of pain in his body. The Prophet \ufdfa told him: 'Place your hand where it hurts and say Bismillah 3 times, then say this 7 times.' He said: 'I did so, and Allah removed my pain!'","https://www.duaandazkar.com/audio_new/CH6DUA1.mp3",B.a0z)
B.a7K=s(["adam","repentance","forgiveness","prophet"],t.s)
B.Rx=new A.bc("prophet-adam","Dua of Prophet Adam (AS)","The Master Supplication of Sincere Repentance",u.O,"Rabbana zalamna anfusana wa in lam taghfir lana wa tarhamna lana-koonanna minal-khasireen","Our Lord! We have wronged ourselves, and if You do not forgive us and have mercy upon us, we will surely be among the losers.","Surah Al-A'raf 7:23",3,"The words taught by Allah to Adam and Hawwa upon their remorse. Recited by believers seeking unconditional forgiveness.",null,B.a7K)
