B.Sg=new A.bc("prophet-ayyub","Dua of Prophet Ayyub (Job AS)","For Healing from Illness & Sickness",u.L,"Annee massaniyad-durru wa Anta Arhamur-Rahimeen","Indeed, adversity has touched me, and You are the Most Merciful of the merciful.","Surah Al-Anbiya 21:83",3,"The gentle, dignified prayer of Prophet Ayyub when enduring prolonged bodily affliction. A source of Shifa for the sick.",null,B.a7w)
